4bde2a/uploads/origins/406957c5-79c5-40dd-b5df-0530cb122517?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82f4c9727a01b56b743648ad772f12b2, https://si.imgix.net/ed4bde2a/uploads/origins/406957c5-79c5-40dd-b5df-0530cb122517?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddad940e195ab23f81226e6249e0fe7e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed4bde2a/uploads/origins/406957c5-79c5-40dd-b5df-0530cb122517?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=baea536028606ffa9b2136bb1dffc990 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアートは素晴らしいです！私のVtuberの楽しいビーチのシーンを描いてくれたら、この夏の私のストリームのスタート画面に使いたいわ。彼女はとてもフレンドリーで遊び好きなスペースドラゴンです。もしよければ、彼女のドラゴンのマスコットも加えてください！ポーズはお任せします！彼女がビーチで楽しんでいるポーズなら何でもOK。\n\n彼女の水着の衣装の参考資料があるグーグルドライブをリンクしておいたよ。見づらいですが、髪もポニーテールにしています。\n\nまた、このアートをアニメーションさせたいので、できれば16:9の比率にして、キャラクターと背景のレイヤーを分けてください！\n\nご検討、本当にありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Qm8NVlTJSFxjUlyB5vbdIGK2wD5r22pX?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lc_jam/works/113", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/804e8935/uploads/origins/934bffc1-47be-45b0-b160-743f74c50740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=03bd9e0abdcbd1716c0c7f1d7d69d2f1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/804e8935/uploads/origins/934bffc1-47be-45b0-b160-743f74c50740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=03bd9e0abdcbd1716c0c7f1d7d69d2f1, https://si.imgix.net/804e8935/uploads/origins/934bffc1-47be-45b0-b160-743f74c50740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=629357d77ccceb716a73281659be1130 2x, https://si.imgix.net/804e8935/uploads/origins/934bffc1-47be-45b0-b160-743f74c50740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9eaf148e2ac94a0f2c9552b1a2505f56 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lc_jam/works/112", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f757f17/uploads/origins/088152df-9adf-449e-b2f8-a98660783e54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fd83f3cd4b054803dbb231e03b50986", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1f757f17/uploads/origins/088152df-9adf-449e-b2f8-a98660783e54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fd83f3cd4b054803dbb231e03b50986, https://si.imgix.net/1f757f17/uploads/origins/088152df-9adf-449e-b2f8-a98660783e54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=558e130f31980489ca79aa470b15ce6a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1f757f17/uploads/origins/088152df-9adf-449e-b2f8-a98660783e54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=802c923cc4a2bf6fd4474f05e2cf132e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi lovely Jam! Could I please request an art of my Vtuber persona with an outfit inspired from Sage from Valorant? I would like a more serious expression / fighting action picture. \n\nSage can heal and revive her allies. The outfit doesn't have to be exactly like sage but I would like the teal particle effects or healing orb. \n\nThank you for your consideration and hard work!! 💜🥰", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lc_jam/works/111", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/12627b80/uploads/origins/6a41dfb4-88da-4dc9-b64e-3ddc7c2bd9d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81abefc21b4dd9dbd45830f219e6508f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/12627b80/uploads/origins/6a41dfb4-88da-4dc9-b64e-3ddc7c2bd9d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81abefc21b4dd9dbd45830f219e6508f, https://si.imgix.net/12627b80/uploads/origins/6a41dfb4-88da-4dc9-b64e-3ddc7c2bd9d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8755619048719e4ca154fd5c480f0c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/12627b80/uploads/origins/6a41dfb4-88da-4dc9-b64e-3ddc7c2bd9d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4037da253a16daa7201c81390e1413e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Jam! This one is going to be a pretty big one. I hope you don't feel too overwhelmed by it ;; Feel free to take your time since there's a lot of people in this one. I was thinking with the amount of people it would be hard to think of a large collaborative design to include all of them, so I thought of an idea with my friends. In the google drive, I have listed everyone's OC.\n\nHere are the notes for our photo. \n\nTheme: Beach episode! \nClothing: Your choice \n\nARTOURR - Cheering on ONETOO\nONETOO - Wearing a blindfold, holding a stick for watermelon smashing (but aiming for CLAOUS because of HARU)\nHARU - Shooting water pistol at ONETOO telling him where CLAOUS and BRUTEZ are, instead of the watermelon\nFAUST - Anxiously asking HARU if she should be doing that\nBRUTEZ - Confused and buried in the sand \nTAKU - Holding a shovel and looking proud\nCLAOUS - Next to BRUTEZ (buried) \n- There is a watermelon somewhere near them - \n\nAEON - Fishing in a camping chair \nAGGRO - Sitting in a camping chair next to AEON, playing FGO and talking to GREY\nGREY - Also sitting in a camping chair next to AGGRO, playing FGO and talking to AGGRO \n\nYONKO - Watching MANGO light a sparkler\nMANGO - Holding YONKO and watching LIONREK'S sparkler. \nLIONREK - Lighting a sparkler (firework)\nTRISTAN - Carrying back a bucket of water \n \nBEPSI - Sitting at a table, drinking and playing cards \nCURSED - Sitting at a table, 